Statement of modification, as required by section 3(c)(i):

    RawGen has modified the FLUX.1 [dev] Model. `kontext_lora.pt` is a LoRA
    adapter trained on the FLUX.1-Kontext-dev transformer; it contains only
    adapter tensors and no base weights. `vae_decoder_xyz.pt` is a full
    fine-tune of the FLUX.1-dev VAE decoder, retrained to decode latents to
